flowchart TD
  B["1 bit: one switch, 0 or 1"] --> Y["1 byte = 8 bits: values 0 to 255, THE unit of addressing"]
  Y --> N["address: the byte's own number, values written in hex"]
  N --> W["word = 8 bytes here: char 1, short 2, int 4, double 8, pointer 8"]
  W --> C["contiguous block: n elements of the same type, stride = sizeof T"]
  C --> S["structure: a decided layout along the lane"]
  S --> A["array: base + i x sizeof T, access O 1"]
  S --> L["linked list: each node stores the next node's address, access O n"]
